---
description: >-
  Verifies that a node declared inside a `global` block stays anchored at the
  root level, outside the `flow pipeline` container, even though that
  container references it in an edge chain.
---
%% Without the `global` block, referencing A inside the flow would pull it
%% into the container. Declaring it global anchors it at root level.
agentflow-beta TB

global
  A["Shared input"]
end

flow pipeline["Pipeline"]
  A --> B["Process"] --> C["Publish"]
end
